{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13755","headline":"瑶草春 · 顾况","name":"瑶草春","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"瑶草春，杳容与，江南艳歌京西舞。\n执心轻子都，信节冠秋胡。\n议以腰支嫁，时论自有夫。\n蝉鬓蛾眉明井底，燕裙赵袂萦辘轳。\n李生闻之泪如绠，不忍回头看此井。\n月中桂树落一枝，池上鵁鶄唳孤影。\n露桃穠李自成谿，流水终天不向西。\n翠帐绿窗寒寂寂，锦茵罗荐夜凄凄。\n瑶草春，丹井远，别後相思意深浅。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"顾况","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13755.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13755","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}